{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Kodoku&quot; is a single-player survival horror game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a bizarre world inside a pot, players must hide from terrifying monsters while collecting &quot;souls.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 The Otherworldly Pot</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, a university professor named Urohoshi, heads deep into the mountains in search of his missing friend, toward a place where a grotesque statue of Kannon is enshrined. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After slipping and falling from a cliff, Urohoshi awakens to find himself in a world inside a giant pot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man whose head is fused with a pot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skeleton pulling a giant ox cart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world ruled by grotesque beings, Urohoshi meets a young girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;Collect souls in the pot for me.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so begins Urohoshi's journey to return to the world of the living...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/extras/71e3986da6b93a70e57683ea073a4578.poster.avif?t=1759477595\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/extras/71e3986da6b93a70e57683ea073a4578.webm?t=1759477595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/extras/71e3986da6b93a70e57683ea073a4578.mp4?t=1759477595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Survival Horror</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can slow down the monsters and grotesque beings, but you cannot defeat them. Players must advance through a world of darkness, fighting against the terror of being pursued.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Souls</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each stage and gather the shining souls. Once you have collected the target number, you can escape through a torii gate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utilize the Pot</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pot you carry can be thrown once you have collected a certain number of souls. This allows you to divert an enemy's attention or press buttons to open doors above you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/extras/316aa3ec4c768867de835ad8becfdb35.poster.avif?t=1759477595\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/extras/316aa3ec4c768867de835ad8becfdb35.webm?t=1759477595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/extras/316aa3ec4c768867de835ad8becfdb35.mp4?t=1759477595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 A World of Beautiful Demise</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bizarre world within the pot is filled with someone's regrets and trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A burning, scorched earth. The bottom of an abyssal valley. A temple steeped in vanity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of his lonely journey, what truth awaits Urohoshi?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864610?t=1759477595","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864610?t=1759477595","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/436bca86b2c9b569cfb581f3cf5c0e8b2f546076/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759477595","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/436bca86b2c9b569cfb581f3cf5c0e8b2f546076/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759477595","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Violence by monsters against the player"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Kodoku&quot; is a single-player survival horror game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a bizarre world inside a pot, players must hide from terrifying monsters while collecting &quot;souls.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 The Otherworldly Pot</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, a university professor named Urohoshi, heads deep into the mountains in search of his missing friend, toward a place where a grotesque statue of Kannon is enshrined. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After slipping and falling from a cliff, Urohoshi awakens to find himself in a world inside a giant pot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man whose head is fused with a pot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skeleton pulling a giant ox cart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world ruled by grotesque beings, Urohoshi meets a young girl.</p><p class=\"b